# CLAUDE.md — Market Maker Service

## 1. ROLE OF THIS DOCUMENT

You are working inside the existing **Perpetual Futures Exchange** project.

Your task is to build a small, reliable, production-oriented **Market Maker Service** inside the `market_maker/` directory.

This service exists for one primary purpose:

> Continuously provide simulated liquidity to the exchange by observing real-time market prices from Binance and placing/maintaining buy and sell orders on our own exchange around that external reference price.

This is **not** intended to be a sophisticated trading system, quantitative trading platform, arbitrage engine, portfolio manager, or high-frequency trading infrastructure.

The objective is to build the **smallest practical service that continuously keeps our exchange's order book populated with realistic bid/ask liquidity**, while being resilient enough to run continuously in production.

