# 4. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

The Market Maker Service should provide liquidity to one or more exchange markets.

Example:

```text
External reference:

Binance BTC/USDT
        ↓
     $100,000
```

The bot calculates:

```text
Bid: $99,950
Ask: $100,050
```

and places:

```text
BUY  BTC-USDT-PERP
0.001 BTC @ 99,950

SELL BTC-USDT-PERP
0.001 BTC @ 100,050
```

If Binance moves:

```text
$100,000 → $100,100
```

the bot should update its quotes:

```text
BUY  @ $100,050
SELL @ $100,150
```

The exact spread, quantity, refresh interval, and market should be configuration-driven.

