# 5. CORE PRINCIPLE

The bot is a **liquidity provider**, not a trading simulator that blindly executes:

```text
BUY
SELL
BUY
SELL
BUY
SELL
```

Do NOT implement a naive loop that randomly buys and sells.

Instead, the bot should continuously maintain:

```text
        External Price
             │
             ▼
       Quote Calculation
          /        \
         /          \
        ▼            ▼
      BID            ASK
```

The purpose is to keep resting liquidity on both sides of the exchange order book.

Users trading against the exchange can then consume those orders.

This creates realistic exchange activity.

