# 14. STALE PRICE PROTECTION

This is mandatory.

Maintain:

```text
lastPriceUpdateTimestamp
```

If:

```text
currentTime - lastPriceUpdateTimestamp > PRICE_STALE_MS
```

the bot must immediately enter:

```text
QUOTING PAUSED
```

state.

While price data is stale:

* DO NOT place new orders.
* DO NOT update quotes using stale data.
* Preferably cancel active market-making orders to avoid stale liquidity.
* Attempt to reconnect to Binance.
* Resume only after a fresh valid price is received.

Expected lifecycle:

```text
Binance connected
      ↓
Fresh price
      ↓
QUOTING
      ↓
WebSocket disconnected
      ↓
PRICE STALE
      ↓
CANCEL ACTIVE QUOTES
      ↓
RECONNECT
      ↓
Fresh price received
      ↓
QUOTING RESUMED
```

