The Binance WebSocket must automatically reconnect.

Use exponential backoff.

Example:

```text
1 second
2 seconds
4 seconds
8 seconds
16 seconds
30 seconds
30 seconds
...
```

Do not create an infinite rapid reconnect loop.

On successful reconnection:

```text
reset retry counter
