# 22. QUOTE REFRESH LOOP

The bot should have a controlled quote refresh interval.

Example:

```env
QUOTE_REFRESH_MS=1000
```

This does NOT mean Binance price is sampled only once per second.

Binance can update continuously.

Instead:

```text
Binance WebSocket
       │
       ▼
latestPrice
       │
       ▼
quote refresh loop
       │
       ▼
calculate desired quotes
       │
       ▼
compare against active orders
```

This prevents excessive API requests.

Do not create an order operation for every market-data tick.

